        ["med", 220, "text-evidence", "Which detail best supports reef importance?", ["Reefs slow waves before they reach shore.", "Bleached reefs are always bright.", "Water can stay warm.", "Algae is a short word."], "Wave protection is a concrete benefit to coastal communities."],
        ["high", 234, "inference", "What can be inferred about recovery?", ["Recovery depends on stress decreasing over time.", "Bleached coral cannot ever recover.", "Coastal communities cause every bleaching event.", "Algae never affects coral."], "The passage says bleached reefs need time to recover, implying conditions must improve."]
