        ["high", 236, "paired-passage-set", "Which decision would consider both sources?", ["Build lanes in phases while preserving temporary customer access.", "Ignore all business owners.", "Cancel all transportation planning.", "Build only where no people live."], "A phased plan addresses safety goals and construction disruption."],
        ["adv", 244, "paired-passage-set", "What additional information is most useful?", ["Traffic and sales data before, during, and after lane construction", "The favorite color of each cyclist", "A list of store signs", "The planner's commute playlist"], "Before-and-after data would test both traffic and business claims."]
